# What never belongs in the image build context.
#
# cargo writes target/ on a workstation, and it holds gigabytes that the
# build inside the image never reads: the image compiles the crate again on
# its own pinned toolchain. The submodule carries a target/ of its own once
# somebody runs the crate's checks in place.
target/
brand/iced/target/

# The brand repository is a Hugo theme as well as a crate. The image needs
# the crate and the two files it parses, and the Dockerfile names them, so
# the rest of that checkout stays out of the context.
brand/.git
brand/assets/
brand/data/
brand/layouts/
brand/static/
brand/crdref/
brand/linkcheck/
